  "prefLabel": "Phy 303.01 Method of Applying for the National Physical Therapy Examination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 303.01 Method of Applying for the National Physical Therapy Examination. Those seeking to apply for initial licensure as a physical therapist or physical therapist assistant in New Hampshire shall register directly with the testing organization, as required by Plc 303.03 to take the national physical therapy examination for physical therapists or the national physical therapy examination for physical therapist assistants, as applicable.\n\nSource. #9233, eff 8-22-08; ss by #10933, eff 9-18-15; ss by #12864, eff 9-10-19; ss by #14563, eff 6-20-26, EXPIRES: 6-20-36",
